      "content": "those are okay but they feel a little bit \"safe\" or surface level for a late night show. we want them to be punchier and maybe a bit more edgy/provocative. like, if we're gonna do this, we gotta go for the stuff that people usually think is \"off limits.\" can you give me some more biting ones? maybe go more into the deeper cultural tropes or things that are a bit more controversial for those same groups?",
